{"text": "purity", "etymologies": [{"etymologyHTML": "<p>From <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\">pure</i> +\u200e <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\">-ity</i>, from Old French <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"fro\">purete</i>, from Latin <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"la\">puritas</i>.\n</p>", "pos": [{"pos": "Noun", "definitions": [{"definition": "The state or degree of being pure.\n", "quote": [], "relative": {"Antonym": ["impurity"]}}]}]}], "pronunciation": [["Received Pronunciation", "/\u02c8pj\u028a\u0259\u0279\u026ati/"], ["General American", "/\u02c8pj\u028a\u0279\u026ati/"]]}